    "headline_insight": {
      "as_of": "2026-06-26T00:49:28.886859+00:00",
      "insight": "Readers click fee stories not for the mechanics of fee calculation, but for the political economy underneath — who captures fees, who proposes pausing or redirecting them, and whether insiders are extracting value that should flow to the ecosystem.",
